<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Standard Oil and the Founding of the Modern Oil Industry on Local Time System</title><link>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/</link><description>Recent content in Standard Oil and the Founding of the Modern Oil Industry on Local Time System</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><copyright>Local Time System</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 15 May 1911 12:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Articles Of Incorporation</title><link>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/articles-of-incorporation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 10 Jan 1870 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/articles-of-incorporation/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;John D. Rockefeller and partners file Articles of Incorporation in Ohio.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="keyframe-record"&gt;Keyframe record&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;keyframe&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;articles-of-incorporation&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;founding:T-01:00:00&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;recorded&lt;/strong&gt;: 1870-01-10T12:00:00.000Z&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;segment&lt;/strong&gt;: —&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;significance&lt;/strong&gt;: 0.8 · &lt;strong&gt;certainty&lt;/strong&gt;: 1&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tags&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;incorporation&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;ohio&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;legal&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Stems from the &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="link link--text" href="https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/"&gt;Standard Oil and the Founding of the Modern Oil Industry overview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Founding Day</title><link>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/founding-day/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Feb 1870 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/founding-day/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Standard Oil Company officially founded in Cleveland, Ohio.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="keyframe-record"&gt;Keyframe record&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;keyframe&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;founding-day&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;founding:T+00:00:00&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;recorded&lt;/strong&gt;: 1870-02-01T12:00:00.000Z&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;segment&lt;/strong&gt;: —&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;significance&lt;/strong&gt;: 1 · &lt;strong&gt;certainty&lt;/strong&gt;: 1&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tags&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;founding&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;zero-point&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;milestone&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Stems from the &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="link link--text" href="https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/"&gt;Standard Oil and the Founding of the Modern Oil Industry overview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Trust Agreement</title><link>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/trust-agreement/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Jan 1879 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/trust-agreement/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Standard Oil Trust Agreement signed, consolidating control under a single board of trustees.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="keyframe-record"&gt;Keyframe record&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;keyframe&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;trust-agreement&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;founding:T+00:03:00&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;recorded&lt;/strong&gt;: 1879-01-02T12:00:00.000Z&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;segment&lt;/strong&gt;: —&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;significance&lt;/strong&gt;: 0.9 · &lt;strong&gt;certainty&lt;/strong&gt;: 1&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tags&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;trust&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;monopoly&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;legal&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Stems from the &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="link link--text" href="https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/"&gt;Standard Oil and the Founding of the Modern Oil Industry overview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Trust Consolidation</title><link>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/trust-consolidation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Jan 1882 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/trust-consolidation/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Standard Oil Trust reorganised; boundary between the trust era and the monopoly era.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="keyframe-record"&gt;Keyframe record&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;keyframe&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;trust-consolidation&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;founding:T+09:00:00&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;recorded&lt;/strong&gt;: 1882-01-02T12:00:00.000Z&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;segment&lt;/strong&gt;: —&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;significance&lt;/strong&gt;: 0.85 · &lt;strong&gt;certainty&lt;/strong&gt;: 0.6&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tags&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;trust&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;reorganisation&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;monopoly&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;presumed&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Stems from the &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="link link--text" href="https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/"&gt;Standard Oil and the Founding of the Modern Oil Industry overview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Supreme Court Breakup</title><link>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/supreme-court-breakup/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 May 1911 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/history-standard-oil-1870/supreme-court-breakup/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;U.S. Supreme Court rules Standard Oil is an illegal monopoly and orders its dissolution into 34 companies.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="keyframe-record"&gt;Keyframe record&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;keyframe&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;supreme-court-breakup&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;address&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;founding:T+41:00:00&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;recorded&lt;/strong&gt;: 1911-05-15T12:00:00.000Z&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;segment&lt;/strong&gt;: —&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;significance&lt;/strong&gt;: 1 · &lt;strong&gt;certainty&lt;/strong&gt;: 1&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;tags&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;antitrust&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;breakup&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;supreme-court&lt;/code&gt; &lt;code&gt;monopoly&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Stems from the &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="link link--text" href="https://james-gibson.github.io/local-time/docs/site/docs/lore/"&gt;Standard Oil and the Founding of the Modern Oil Industry overview&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>